OL,3,GNEWSADementia cafe celebrates fourth
OL,4,Abirthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA support group which makes a "massive
OL,7,Fdifference" to people living with
OL,8,Fdementia, their families, and carers
OL,9,Fhas celebrated its fourth birthday.
OL,11,FBilston Memory Cafe is run by the
OL,12,FBilston and Willenhall Lions group, and
OL,13,Fmeets on the second Tuesday of every
OL,14,Fmonth at Bilston Sports and Social
OL,15,FClub.
OL,17,FIt celebrated the special occasion with
OL,18,Fmusic, dancing and entertainment.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
