OL,3,GNEWSADementia cafe celebrates fourth
OL,4,Abirthday
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have a lot of volunteers, both from
OL,7,Fthe Lions and other individuals, and we
OL,8,Fare really appreciative of their
OL,9,Fsupport for the cafe, which is making a
OL,10,Fmassive difference for people living
OL,11,Fwith dementia and their families," said
OL,12,FStuart Richmond from the Lions.
